{% assign thread2 = 'AS|Ananya S.|Bengaluru|Compact design weekend travel ke liye useful lagta hai. Essentials ek hi case mein rakhne ka idea convenient hai.,SR|Sneha R.|Kochi|I would choose this for the combination of a mirror, light and storage rather than carrying them separately.|That thoughtful combination is what we set out to create. Thank you, Sneha.,JP|Jhanvi P.|Ahmedabad|The separate spaces for beauty essentials make the inside look easy to arrange and scan.,NB|Neha B.|Bhopal|Brushes, palettes aur small items ke liye dedicated space hona daily clutter ko manage kar sakta hai.,PS|Priya S.|Delhi|I like how the mirror and storage are combined in one case. It looks useful for an everyday getting-ready routine.,SG|Simran G.|Chandigarh|Mirror light aur organised storage daily routine ko simpler bana sakte hain.,KL|Keerthi L.|Mysuru|The illuminated mirror looks like a useful addition when the room light is not ideal.,MG|Mansi G.|Vadodara|Everyday makeup aur jewellery ko ek neat case mein rakhne ka concept achha hai.' | split: ',' %}
{% assign thread3 = 'NK|Nisha K.|Jaipur|Pink finish gifting ke liye elegant choice lagti hai. Illuminated mirror design ka thoughtful feature hai.|Thank you for noticing the details, Nisha. We wanted the case to feel useful and gift-worthy.,RV|Radhika V.|Hyderabad|The compact format feels like a considered option for home as well as travel.|Thank you, Radhika. Please follow the supplied product guide and current airline rules when travelling.,AK|Ayesha K.|Lucknow|Makeup, brushes aur small accessories ko ek jagah organise karne ka idea kaafi convenient hai.|Bilkul, Ayesha. Different item sizes ka fit individual products par depend karega.,FS|Farah S.|Mumbai|Ready hote waqt mirror aur products ek jagah milna genuinely useful concept lagta hai.|Thank you, Farah. Light and storage together are central to the LIVOARA design.,PP|Pooja P.|Indore|Travel ke waqt makeup ko organised rakhne ke liye ye format kaafi sensible lagta hai.,IC|Ishita C.|Gurugram|A thoughtful all-in-one design for anyone who prefers a tidy getting-ready space.,SC|Sakshi C.|Patna|Dresser par bhi neat lagega aur zarurat par saath carry bhi kiya ja sakta hai.|Thank you, Sakshi. Home-to-travel versatility is an important part of the design.,RN|Reema N.|Nashik|A simple idea, but combining the mirror and organised interior could make daily routines much easier.' | split: ',' %}
<div class="comments-grid exact" style="margin-top:1.75rem" role="feed" aria-label="Illustrative customer discussion">
{% for t in (1..3) %}
  {% if t == 1 %}{% assign comments = thread1 %}{% elsif t == 2 %}{% assign comments = thread2 %}{% else %}{% assign comments = thread3 %}{% endif %}
  <div class="comment-thread" aria-label="Comment thread {{ t }}">
    <div class="comment-head"><strong>Comments</strong><small class="muted">Thread {{ t }}</small></div>
    {% for c in comments %}{% assign p = c | split: '|' %}
      <article class="comment"><span class="avatar">{{ p[0] }}</span><div><div class="bubble"><strong>{{ p[1] }}</strong><p>{{ p[3] }}</p></div><p class="comment-meta"><span>{{ p[2] }}</span><span>Like</span><span>Reply</span><span>Sample</span></p>{% if p[4] != blank %}<div class="brand-reply"><span class="avatar brand-avatar">L</span><div><div class="bubble reply"><strong>LIVOARA <em>Author</em></strong><p>{{ p[4] }}</p></div><p class="comment-meta">Like · Reply</p></div></div>{% endif %}</div></article>
    {% endfor %}
    <div class="comment-input">Write a comment…</div>
  </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
